(i) be a retired Judicial Officer below the age of 62 years as on the last date of submission of the application as per notice, preferably retired recently.
(ii) have worked as a District Judge;
(iii) have no adverse reporting during his/her service tenure; and
(iv) have no disciplinary or criminal proceeding pending against him/her at the time of application.
